WEBVTT

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:31.670
(Applause)

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.230
SRK: Greetings, Ritu Ji.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:35.730
Thank you so much.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:42.820
You took out time and presented the work 
on Mars Mission to all of us here.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.870
Actually I want to say something.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:48.560
All the audience sitting here, the ones
watching on the television will agree.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.160
When the mission was successful

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:55.180
every Indian was beaming 
with pride at your achievement.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.510
so a big round of applause for all of us.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.210
(Applause)